{% comment %}
  Self-Contained International Phone Field Component with Shopify Country Integration

  This component includes all necessary CSS and JavaScript inline to ensure it works
  independently without requiring external asset loading in theme.liquid or sections.

  Accepts:
  - id: Input ID
  - name: Input name
  - value: Input value
  - label: Label text
  - required: Whether the field is required (default: false)
  - readonly: Whether the field is readonly (default: false)
  - class: Additional CSS classes
  - error_id: ID for the error message element (optional, deprecated)
  - error_message: Error message to display (optional, deprecated - now uses setCustomValidity)
{% endcomment %}

